{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_actors(npc.UUID) %}
{{speakingNpc.name}} stops a nearby person from putting a leash on them. Use only when the speaker is able to prevent the collar — they can block, overpower, or otherwise stop it — not when they merely object or dislike it. Does not put a leash on anyone.
Available actors: {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}. Never pick anyone not listed.
